SUMMARY:Bromyard Christmas lights - Food bank run
DESCRIPTION:Leader: Lily Price\n\nCome and be amazed by the Christmas light
 s in Bromyard! 🎄\nMeet outside the Bromyard cemetery\, there is parking 
 road side in Church street before or a little parking laybay after cemetery
 . \n5km in however long it takes!! Stopping for lots of photos 🎄🎄\nEv
 eryone welcome 🤗 \nChristmas attire mandatory! 😆🎄🎅🏻\n\nTo su
 pport the Malvern food bank at what is always a difficult time of year. Ple
 ase could people bring an item that will be taken to the Lyttleton Well for
  them to distribute.\nI will add their current shortages/requests nearer th
 e time to a discussion post but please feel free to bring anything you may 
 already have that isn't on the list.\nThey will be grateful for all.\n\nRun
  Leaders Lily and Sarah Fowkes\n\nView on Strava: https://www.strava.com/cl
 ubs/208705/group_events/3557697739652081526\n\nSynced from Strava Club 2087
